{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Multica discovers the profile only after `--probe` returns protocol version 1.\nFor a non-standard DS"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"H installation, point the daemon at its launcher:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The runtime contract includes:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- model and thinking-level discovery from DSH itself;\n- committed text, reasoning, tool, result, and"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" token-usage events;\n- cooperative cancellation and durable session resume;\n- canonical Multica MCP "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"configuration translated to DSH stdio or\nstreamable-HTTP clients;\n- per-runtime/agent session roots "},{"id":"p16s4","text":"supplied by the Multica daemon;\n- headless one-shot approvals, with no interactive question surface."},{"id":"p16s5","text":"\n- narrowly forwards only Multica's server-minted `mat_` task token into DSH's\notherwise credential-"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"scrubbed shell, so in-task `multica` commands retain\ntask attribution without exposing model-provide"},{"id":"p16s7","text":", so in-task `multica` commands retain\ntask attribution without exposing model-provider credentials."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The local `.local/` tree is ignored. It may hold an isolated DSH home and a\ndevelopment launcher, bu"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"t neither belongs in source control."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"`DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` is read by DSH's credential provider at process runtime. It\nmust not be stored in"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"` is read by DSH's credential provider at process runtime. It\nmust not be stored in this repository."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

